<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>满意红 · 驾驶舱 1.0</title>
<style>
/* ========== 暖色 VI 体系 ========== */
:root {
  --paper-white:      #F5F0E6;
  --card-white:        #FFFFFF;
  --card-warm:         #FAF6EF;
  --ink:               #4A3728;
  --accent-red:        #C23B22;
  --accent-gold:       #B8860B;
  --border-warm:       #E0D5C8;
  --green-ok:          #3D7A4F;
  --amber-warn:        #C2780A;
  --ink-light:         #7A6958;
  --ink-lighter:       #A89880;
  --shadow-subtle:     rgba(74,55,40,0.06);
  --shadow-medium:     rgba(74,55,40,0.10);
}
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
body {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Text', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
  background: var(--paper-white); color: var(--ink); min-height: 100vh; line-height: 1.6;
}

/* 密码门 */
#gate {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  min-height: 100vh; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; background: var(--paper-white);
}
#gate .gate-logo {
  width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-red); color: white;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.6em; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 8px;
}
#gate h1 { font-size: 2.2em; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
#gate .subtitle { color: var(--ink-light); font-size: 0.95em; margin-bottom: 16px; }
#gate input {
  background: var(--card-white); border: 1px solid var(--border-warm); color: var(--ink);
  padding: 12px 20px; width: 260px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 1.1em; text-align: center; outline: none;
  transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
}
#gate input:focus { border-color: var(--accent-gold); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(184,134,11,0.1); }
#gate button {
  background: var(--accent-red); color: #fff; border: none; padding: 11px 44px; border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: 1.05em; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; letter-spacing: 0.04em; font-weight: 500;
}
#gate button:hover { background: #A8351E; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(194,59,34,0.25); }
#gate .hint { color: var(--ink-lighter); font-size: 0.82em; }

/* 应用主体 + 标签导航 */
#app { display:none; max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 80px; }
.nav-tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-warm); padding-bottom: 0; }
.nav-tab {
  background: none; border: none; color: var(--ink-light); padding: 10px 18px;
  font-size: 0.88em; cursor: pointer; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; margin-bottom: -2px;
  transition: all 0.2s; letter-spacing: 0.03em; font-weight: 400;
}
.nav-tab:hover { color: var(--ink); }
.nav-tab.active { color: var(--accent-red); border-bottom-color: var(--accent-red); font-weight: 600; }
.tab-panel { display: none; }
.tab-panel.active { display: block; }

/* Header */
.header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
.header h1 { font-size: 1.95em; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.header h1 .accent { color: var(--accent-red); }
.header .dateline { color: var(--ink-light); font-size: 0.85em; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

/* 加载状态 */
.loading { text-align: center; padding: 40px; color: var(--ink-lighter); font-style: italic; }
.load-error { text-align: center; padding: 40px; color: var(--accent-red); }
.load-error details { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.82em; color: var(--ink-light); text-align: left; }

/* ========== 总览卡片 ========== */
.overview-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
.ov-card {
  background: var(--card-white); border: 1px solid var(--border-warm); border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 18px 16px; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle); transition: border-color 0.3s;
}
.ov-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent-gold); }
.ov-card .ov-num { font-size: 2em; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
.ov-card .ov-label { font-size: 0.8em; color: var(--ink-light); margin-top: 4px; }
.ov-card .ov-sub { font-size: 0.72em; color: var(--ink-lighter); margin-top: 6px; }

/* 族分布条 */
.family-bars { margin-bottom: 28px; padding: 16px 20px; background: var(--card-white); border: 1px solid var(--border-warm); border-radius: 12px; }
.family-bars h4 { font-size: 0.88em; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.bar-row { display:flex; align-items:center; margin-bottom:6px; gap:8px; }
.bar-label { width:36px; text-align:right; font-size:0.78em; color: var(--ink-light); flex-shrink:0; }
.bar-track { flex:1; height:22px; background: #F0EBE0; border-radius:5px; overflow:hidden; position:relative; }
.bar-fill { height:100%; border-radius:5px; transition:width 0.5s ease; display:flex; align-items:center; padding-left:8px; font-size:0.7em; color:#fff; min-width:0; }
.bar-fill._mirror { background: var(--accent-gold); } .bar-fill._scale { background: var(--green-ok); }
.bar-fill._contract { background: var(--accent-red); } .bar-fill._sense { background: var(--ink); }
.bar-fill._human { background: #6B5B4E; } .bar-fill._tao { background: #8B7355; }
.bar-fill._chapter { background: #7A6958; } .bar-fill._unclassed { background: var(--ink-lighter); }
.bar-count { width:28px; text-align:center; font-size:0.76em; color: var(--ink-light); flex-shrink:0; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }

/* ========== 产品表 ========== */
.section-head { font-size:1em; font-weight:500; color: var(--accent-gold); margin-bottom:14px; letter-spacing:0.04em; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
.section-head::after { content:''; flex:1; height:1px; background: var(--border-warm); }
.family-filters { display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:12px; }
.family-filt {
  background: var(--card-white); border:1px solid var(--border-warm); color: var(--ink-light);
  padding:5px 14px; border-radius:18px; font-size:0.8em; cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s; letter-spacing:0.03em;
}
.family-filt:hover { border-color: var(--accent-gold); color: var(--ink); }
.family-filt.active { background: var(--accent-gold); color:#fff; border-color: var(--accent-gold); }
.btn-outline {
  background: var(--card-white); border:1px solid var(--accent-gold); color: var(--accent-gold);
  padding:7px 16px; border-radius:8px; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.84em; font-weight:500; transition:all 0.2s; letter-spacing:0.03em;
}
.btn-outline:hover { background: var(--accent-gold); color:#fff; }

.detail-wrap { display:none; background: var(--card-white); border:1px solid var(--border-warm); border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle); margin-top:10px; }
.detail-wrap.show { display:block; }
.detail-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:0.84em; }
.detail-table thead { background: var(--card-warm); }
.detail-table th { text-align:left; padding:10px 12px; color: var(--ink-light); font-weight:500; font-size:0.8em; letter-spacing:0.03em; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm); }
.detail-table td { padding:8px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm); color: var(--ink); }
.detail-table tbody tr:hover { background: var(--card-warm); }
.detail-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }
.detail-table .check-col { width:36px; text-align:center; }
.detail-table .check-col input[type=checkbox] { width:15px; height:15px; accent-color: var(--accent-red); cursor:pointer; }
.detail-table .prod-link { color: var(--accent-red); text-decoration:none; font-weight:500; transition:color 0.2s; }
.detail-table .prod-link:hover { color: var(--accent-gold); text-decoration:underline; }

.family-badge { display:inline-block; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; font-size:0.78em; font-weight:500; }
.family-badge.镜 { background: rgba(184,134,11,0.12); color: var(--accent-gold); }
.family-badge.衡 { background: rgba(61,122,79,0.12); color: var(--green-ok); }
.family-badge.契 { background: rgba(194,59,34,0.08); color: var(--accent-red); }
.family-badge.觉 { background: rgba(74,55,40,0.08); color: var(--ink); }
.family-badge.人 { background: rgba(107,91,78,0.10); color: #6B5B4E; }
.family-badge.道 { background: rgba(139,115,85,0.10); color: #8B7355; }
.family-badge.章 { background: rgba(122,105,88,0.10); color: #7A6958; }
.family-badge.未归类 { background: rgba(168,152,128,0.12); color: var(--ink-lighter); }

/* 对比栏 */
.cmp-bar { display:none; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-top:12px; padding:10px 14px; background: var(--card-warm); border:1px solid var(--border-warm); border-radius:10px; }
.cmp-bar.show { display:flex; }
.cmp-bar .cmp-count { color: var(--accent-red); font-weight:600; }
.btn-cmp {
  background: var(--accent-red); color:#fff; border:none; padding:7px 20px; border-radius:8px;
  cursor:pointer; font-size:0.84em; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.03em; transition:all 0.2s;
}
.btn-cmp:hover { background:#A8351E; }
.btn-cmp:disabled { background: var(--ink-lighter); cursor:not-allowed; }

/* L3 对比弹层 */
.cmp-overlay { display:none; position:fixed; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:100%; background:rgba(74,55,40,0.4); z-index:100; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
.cmp-overlay.show { display:flex; }
.cmp-panel {
  background: var(--card-white); border-radius:18px; max-width:800px; width:92%; max-height:85vh; overflow-y:auto;
  padding:28px 24px; position:relative; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(74,55,40,0.2);
}
.cmp-panel h3 { font-size:1.15em; font-weight:500; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom:6px; }
.cmp-panel .cmp-sub { color: var(--ink-light); font-size:0.8em; margin-bottom:20px; }
.cmp-close {
  position:absolute; top:14px; right:18px; background:none; border:none; color: var(--ink-light);
  font-size:1.5em; cursor:pointer; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:8px; transition:all 0.2s;
}
.cmp-close:hover { background: var(--card-warm); color: var(--accent-red); }
.cmp-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-bottom:24px; font-size:0.84em; }
.cmp-table th { text-align:left; padding:10px 12px; background: var(--card-warm); border-bottom:2px solid var(--border-warm); color: var(--ink-light); font-weight:500; font-size:0.8em; }
.cmp-table td { padding:10px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm); color: var(--ink); }
.cmp-table td:first-child { font-weight:500; }

/* 任务面板 */
.task-filters { display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:12px; }
.task-item {
  background: var(--card-white); border:1px solid var(--border-warm); border-radius:10px; padding:14px 16px;
  margin-bottom: 8px; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; transition:border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
}
.task-item:hover { border-color: var(--accent-gold); box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium); }
.task-item.p0 { border-left:3px solid var(--accent-red); }
.task-item.p1 { border-left:3px solid var(--amber-warn); }
.task-item.p2 { border-left:3px solid var(--ink-lighter); }
.task-badge { font-size:0.68em; font-weight:600; padding:2px 7px; border-radius:4px; letter-spacing:0.04em; white-space:nowrap; margin-top:2px; }
.task-badge.p0 { background:rgba(194,59,34,0.12); color:var(--accent-red); }
.task-badge.p1 { background:rgba(194,120,10,0.12); color:var(--amber-warn); }
.task-badge.p2 { background:rgba(168,152,128,0.12); color:var(--ink-lighter); }
.task-body { flex:1; }
.task-title { font-size:0.9em; margin-bottom:2px; color:var(--ink); }
.task-desc { font-size:0.8em; color:var(--ink-light); }

/* 健康仪表 */
.gauge-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap:12px; margin-bottom:28px; }
.gauge-card {
  background: var(--card-white); border:1px solid var(--border-warm); border-radius:14px;
  padding:20px 16px; transition:border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s; box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
}
.gauge-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent-gold); box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium); }
.gauge-card .g-icon { font-size:1.4em; margin-bottom:6px; }
.gauge-card .g-name { font-size:0.82em; color:var(--ink-light); margin-bottom:2px; }
.gauge-card .g-target { font-size:0.7em; color:var(--ink-lighter); }
.gauge-card .g-val { font-size:1.6em; font-weight:300; letter-spacing:0.03em; color:var(--ink); }
.gauge-card .g-bar-outer { height:4px; background:var(--border-warm); border-radius:2px; margin-top:10px; overflow:hidden; }
.gauge-card .g-bar-inner { height:100%; border-radius:2px; transition:width 0.6s ease; }
.gauge-card .g-status { font-size:0.76em; margin-top:6px; color:var(--ink-light); }
.gauge-card.ok { border-left:3px solid var(--green-ok); }
.gauge-card.ok .g-bar-inner { background:var(--green-ok); }
.gauge-card.warn { border-left:3px solid var(--amber-warn); }
.gauge-card.warn .g-bar-inner { background:var(--amber-warn); }
.gauge-card.bad { border-left:3px solid var(--accent-red); }
.gauge-card.bad .g-bar-inner { background:var(--accent-red); }

/* 日志 */
.log-item { display:flex; gap:10px; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm); font-size:0.84em; align-items:flex-start; }
.log-item:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
.log-time { color:var(--ink-lighter); font-size:0.78em; white-space:nowrap; min-width:48px; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
.log-icon { min-width:24px; text-align:center; }
.log-msg { color:var(--ink-light); flex:1; }

/* 客户 */
.cust-card {
  background: var(--card-white); border:1px solid var(--border-warm); border-radius:12px;
  padding:20px 18px; margin-bottom:10px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle); transition:border-color 0.3s;
}
.cust-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent-gold); }
.cust-card h4 { font-size:1em; font-weight:500; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:6px; }
.cust-card .cust-meta { font-size:0.8em; color:var(--ink-light); margin-bottom:4px; }
.cust-card .cust-needs { font-size:0.82em; color:var(--ink-light); }

/* Footer */
.footer { text-align:center; padding-top:24px; margin-top:20px; border-top:1px solid var(--border-warm); color:var(--ink-lighter); font-size:0.76em; letter-spacing:0.04em; }
.footer .q { font-style:italic; margin-top:4px; color:var(--ink-light); }

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  #app { padding:16px 10px 50px; }
  .overview-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .gauge-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .detail-table { font-size:0.76em; }
  .detail-table th, .detail-table td { padding:6px 8px; }
  .cmp-panel { padding:20px 14px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ========== 密码门 ========== -->
<div id="gate">
  <div class="gate-logo">红</div>
  <h1>满意红</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">驾驶舱 1.0 · 活体视图</p>
  <input type="password" id="pw" placeholder="输入通行码" autofocus onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')unlock(document.getElementById('btn-unlock'))">
  <button id="btn-unlock" onclick="unlock(this)">进入</button>
  <p class="hint">提示: 123654</p>
</div>

<!-- ========== 主应用 ========== -->
<div id="app">
  <div class="header">
    <h1><span class="accent">满意红</span> · 驾驶舱 1.0</h1>
    <div class="dateline" id="dateline"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 标签导航 -->
  <div class="nav-tabs" id="nav-tabs"></div>

  <!-- 面板 1-10 -->
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-overview"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-products"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-tasks"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-health"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-activity"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-customers"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-knowledge"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-governance"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-organization"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-archaeology"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-cities"></div>
  <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-flows"></div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div>满意红 · 驾驶舱 1.0 · 为 Egbertie 而建</div>
    <div class="q">「我在学习看清自己——每一步，都更清晰一点。」</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========== L3 比对弹层 ========== -->
<div class="cmp-overlay" id="cmp-overlay">
  <div class="cmp-panel" id="cmp-panel"></div>
</div>

<script>
/* ================================================================
   满意红 · 驾驶舱 1.0 — 零硬编码 · 全动态加载
   数据: entities_index.json (3994实体·43.9%密度) + open_tasks_audit.json (50条未闭环)
   七族: 镜·契·衡·觉·人·道·章
   三层穿透: L1 总览 → L2 详情表 → L3 组合比对
   ================================================================ */

var PASS = '123654';
var EIDX = null;  // entities_index
var TSK = null;   // open_tasks_audit
var PRODS = [];   // 去重后的产品列表
var selProds = [];
var prodFilt = '全部';
var detailOn = false;
var taskFilt = '全部';

/* ===== 密码门 ===== */
function unlock(btn) {
  var v = document.getElementById('pw').value.trim();
  if (v === PASS) {
    sessionStorage.setItem('sri_d1', '1');
    document.getElementById('gate').style.display = 'none';
    document.getElementById('app').style.display = 'block';
    boot();
  } else {
    btn.textContent = '✗ 再试'; btn.style.background = '#8A5030';
    document.getElementById('pw').value = '';
    setTimeout(function(){ btn.textContent = '进入'; btn.style.background = ''; }, 1200);
  }
}

(function(){
  if (sessionStorage.getItem('sri_d1') === '1') {
    document.getElementById('gate').style.display = 'none';
    document.getElementById('app').style.display = 'block';
    boot();
  }
})();

/* ===== 工具 ===== */
function h(s) { return String(s).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').replace(/"/g,'&quot;'); }
function a(s) { return String(s).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/"/g,'&quot;').replace(/'/g,'&#39;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;'); }

function setDate() {
  var n = new Date(), w = ['日','一','二','三','四','五','六'];
  document.getElementById('dateline').textContent =
    n.getFullYear()+'年'+(n.getMonth()+1)+'月'+n.getDate()+'日 · 周'+w[n.getDay()]+' · '+String(n.getHours()).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(n.getMinutes()).padStart(2,'0');
}

/* ===== 启动: fetch JSON → 渲染 ===== */
function boot() {
  setDate();
  Promise.all([
    fetch('entities_index.json').then(function(r){ if(!r.ok) throw Error('HTTP '+r.status); return r.json(); }),
    fetch('open_tasks_audit.json').then(function(r){ if(!r.ok) throw Error('HTTP '+r.status); return r.json(); })
  ]).then(function(arr){
    EIDX = arr[0]; TSK = arr[1];
    // 去重产品
    var seen = {};
    PRODS = [];
    var raw = EIDX.products || [];
    for (var i=0; i<raw.length; i++) {
      if (!seen[raw[i].name]) { seen[raw[i].name] = true; prods.push(raw[i]); }
    }
    buildNav();
    renderOverview();
    renderProducts();
    renderTasks('全部');
    renderHealth();
    renderActivity();
    renderCustomers();
    renderKnowledge();
    renderGovernance();
    renderOrganization();
    renderArchaeology();
    renderCities();
    renderFlows();
    switchTab('tab-overview');
  }).catch(function(e){
    document.getElementById('app').innerHTML = '<div class="load-error"><strong>⚠️ 数据加载失败</strong><details><summary>详情</summary>无法加载数据文件。<br>请确认 entities_index.json 和 open_tasks_audit.json 存在。<br><br>错误: '+h(e.message)+'</details></div>';
  });
}

/* ===== 标签导航 ===== */
function buildNav() {
  var ts = [
    {id:'tab-overview', label:'📊 总览'},
    {id:'tab-products', label:'📦 产品资产 ('+prods.length+')'},
    {id:'tab-tasks', label:'✅ 待办任务 ('+(TSK?TSK.total_open:'?')+')'},
    {id:'tab-health', label:'🫀 健康仪表'},
    {id:'tab-activity', label:'📜 活动日志'},
    {id:'tab-customers', label:'👥 客户视图'},
    {id:'tab-knowledge', label:'📚 知识'},
    {id:'tab-governance', label:'⚖️ 治理'},
    {id:'tab-organization', label:'🏛️ 组织'},
    {id:'tab-archaeology', label:'🏺 考古'},
    {id:'tab-cities', label:'🏙️ 城市市场'},
    {id:'tab-flows', label:'🔌 流仪表板'},
    {id:'tab-admin', label:'⚙️ 管理后台', ext:true, href:'admin-windows.html'}
  ];
  var h = '';
  for (var i=0; i<ts.length; i++) { if (ts[i].ext) h += '<a class="nav-tab" href="'+ts[i].href+'" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-block">'+ts[i].label+' ↗</a>'; else h += '<button class="nav-tab" onclick="switchTab(\''+ts[i].id+'\',this)">'+ts[i].label+'</button>'; }
  document.getElementById('nav-tabs').innerHTML = h;
}

function switchTab(id, btn) {
  var ps = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-panel');
  for (var i=0; i<ps.length; i++) ps[i].classList.remove('active');
  var ts = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-tab');
  for (var i=0; i<ts.length; i++) ts[i].classList.remove('active');
  var p = document.getElementById(id); if (p) p.classList.add('active');
  if (btn) btn.classList.add('active');
  else { var f = document.querySelector('.nav-tab'); if (f) f.classList.add('active'); }
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 1: 总览
   ================================================================ */
function renderOverview() {
  var m = EIDX.meta, bd = m.breakdown, pf = m.product_families, lr = m.living_rules_status;
  var h = '<div class="overview-grid">';
  h += ov(m.total_entities+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 实体</span>','🧬 实体总数', '产品'+bd.products+' · 客户'+bd.customers+' · 任务'+bd.tasks);
  h += ov(bd.products+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 个</span>','📦 产品','7族 · 精品'+m.premium_count+'·线上'+m.online_count+'·可上架'+m.launchable);
  h += ov(bd.customers+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 个</span>','👥 核心客户','+'+bd.customer_profiles+' 画像');
  h += ov(bd.avatars+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 位</span>','🎭 数字替身','5图腾·10专家·6Skill·1蓝军');
  h += ov(m.knowledge_graph_density+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6">%</span>','🕸️ 图谱密度','强'+m.strong_connections+'·中'+m.medium_connections+'·弱'+m.weak_connections);
  h += ov(bd.living_rules+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 条</span>','🧬 生物规则','活'+lr.active+' · 休眠'+lr.dormant+' · 坏'+lr.broken);
  h += ov(bd.crons+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 个</span>','⏱️ Cron','13活 · 连'+m.biological_health.cron_connected);
  h += ov('105<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 天</span>','📅 时间线','2/15→'+m.updated.split('T')[0]);
  h += ov('3<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 代</span>','🔄 继承链','扣子→满意姐→满意红');
  h += ov('100<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6">%</span>','🔍 扫描率','24,947文件全扫描');
  h += '</div>';

  // 七族分布
  if (pf) {
    h += '<div class="family-bars"><h4>📊 七族产品分布</h4>';
    var fks = ['镜','衡','契','觉','人','道','章','未归类'];
    var maxC = 0;
    for (var i=0; i<fks.length; i++) { if ((pf[fks[i]]||0) > maxC) maxC = pf[fks[i]]||0; }
    if (maxC===0) maxC=1;
    var cls = {镜:'_mirror',衡:'_scale',契:'_contract',觉:'_sense',人:'_human',道:'_tao',章:'_chapter',未归类:'_unclassed'};
    for (var i=0; i<fks.length; i++) {
      var k = fks[i], cnt = pf[k]||0, pct = Math.round(cnt/maxC*100), c = cls[k]||'_unclassed';
      h += '<div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">'+k+'</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill '+c+'" style="width:'+pct+'%">'+(cnt>0?cnt:'')+'</div></div><span class="bar-count">'+cnt+'</span></div>';
    }
    h += '</div>';
  }

  // Top 10 产品(精品优先)
  var allProds = EIDX.products || [];
  var jingpin = [];
  var others = [];
  for (var i = 0; i < allProds.length; i++) {
    if (allProds[i].status === '精品') jingpin.push(allProds[i]);
    else others.push(allProds[i]);
  }
  var top10 = jingpin.concat(others).slice(0, 10);
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">🏆 Top 10 产品（精品优先）</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>产品名</th><th>族</th><th>Q值</th><th>链接</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i = 0; i < top10.length; i++) {
    var p = top10[i];
    var fb = p.family || '未归类';
    var q = p.quality_score !== undefined ? p.quality_score : '-';
    var qNote = p.quality_score_note ? ' <span style="font-size:0.72em;color:var(--ink-lighter)">' + h(p.quality_score_note) + '</span>' : '';
    var url = p.url || '';
    var qStyle = '';
    if (p.quality_confidence === 'A') qStyle = 'color:var(--green-ok);font-weight:600';
    else if (p.quality_confidence === 'D') qStyle = 'color:var(--ink-lighter);font-style:italic';
    h += '<tr><td>' + h(p.id) + '</td><td style="font-weight:500">' + h(p.name) + '</td><td><span class="family-badge ' + fb + '">' + fb + '</span></td><td style="' + qStyle + '">' + q + qNote + '</td><td>' + (url ? '<a class="prod-link" href="' + a(url) + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开 →</a>' : '-') + '</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-overview').innerHTML = h;
}

function ov(num, label, sub) {
  return '<div class="ov-card"><div class="ov-num">'+num+'</div><div class="ov-label">'+label+'</div><div class="ov-sub">'+(sub||'')+'</div></div>';
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 2: 产品资产 L1→L2→L3
   ================================================================ */
function renderProducts() {
  var prods = EIDX.products || [];
  // 构建族计数
  var fm = {'全部':prods.length};
  for (var i=0; i<prods.length; i++) { var f = prods[i].family||'未归类'; fm[f] = (fm[f]||0)+1; }

  var h = '<div class="family-filters" id="prod-filters">';
  var fo = ['全部','镜','衡','契','觉','人','道','章','未归类'];
  for (var i=0; i<fo.length; i++) {
    var k = fo[i]; if (fm[k]===undefined) continue;
    h += '<button class="family-filt'+(k===prodFilt?' active':'')+'" onclick="setProdFilt(\''+a(k)+'\',this)">'+k+' ('+fm[k]+')</button>';
  }
  h += '</div>';
  h += '<button class="btn-outline" onclick="toggleDetail(this)" id="btn-detail">'+(detailOn?'收起详情':'展开详情表')+'</button>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap'+(detailOn?' show':'')+'" id="detail-wrap"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th class="check-col">☑</th><th>产品名</th><th>族</th><th>状态</th><th>描述</th><th>链接</th></tr></thead><tbody id="detail-tbody"></tbody></table></div>';
  h += '<div class="cmp-bar" id="cmp-bar"><span>已选 <span class="cmp-count" id="cmp-count">0</span> 个</span><button class="btn-cmp" id="btn-cmp" disabled onclick="openCmp(this)">对比选中</button><button class="btn-outline" onclick="clearSel(this)">清空</button></div>';
  document.getElementById('tab-products').innerHTML = h;
  renderDetailRows();
  updateCmpBar();
}

function renderDetailRows() {
  var filt = [];
  for (var i=0; i<prods.length; i++) {
    if (prodFilt==='全部' || (prods[i].family||'未归类')===prodFilt) filt.push(prods[i]);
  }
  var h = '';
  for (var i=0; i<filt.length; i++) {
    var p = filt[i], chk = (selProds.indexOf(p.name)>=0?' checked':'');
    var fb = p.family||'未归类';
    var desc = (p.description||'').substring(0,60);
    if (p.description && p.description.length>60) desc+='…';
    var url = p.url||'';
    h += '<tr><td class="check-col"><input type="checkbox"'+chk+' onclick="toggleSel(this,\''+a(p.name)+'\')"></td><td>'+h(p.name)+'</td><td><span class="family-badge '+fb+'">'+fb+'</span></td><td>'+(p.status||p.maturity||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.8em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(desc||'')+'</td><td>'+(url?'<a class="prod-link" href="'+a(url)+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开 →</a>':'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  document.getElementById('detail-tbody').innerHTML = h;
}

function setProdFilt(f, btn) {
  prodFilt = f;
  var bs = document.querySelectorAll('#prod-filters .family-filt');
  for (var i=0; i<bs.length; i++) { bs[i].classList.remove('active'); }
  if (btn) btn.classList.add('active');
  renderDetailRows();
}

function toggleDetail(btn) {
  detailOn = !detailOn;
  var w = document.getElementById('detail-wrap');
  if (w) { if (detailOn) w.classList.add('show'); else w.classList.remove('show'); }
  btn.textContent = detailOn ? '收起详情' : '展开详情表';
}

function toggleSel(cb, name) {
  var idx = selProds.indexOf(name);
  if (cb.checked && idx<0) selProds.push(name);
  else if (!cb.checked && idx>=0) selProds.splice(idx,1);
  updateCmpBar();
}

function updateCmpBar() {
  var bar = document.getElementById('cmp-bar'), cnt = document.getElementById('cmp-count'), btn = document.getElementById('btn-cmp');
  if (!bar || !cnt || !btn) return;
  cnt.textContent = selProds.length;
  bar.classList.add('show');
  btn.disabled = selProds.length < 2;
  if (selProds.length===0 && !detailOn) bar.classList.remove('show');
}

function clearSel(btn) {
  selProds = [];
  var cbs = document.querySelectorAll('#detail-tbody input[type=checkbox]');
  for (var i=0; i<cbs.length; i++) cbs[i].checked = false;
  updateCmpBar();
}

/* ===== L3 组合对比 ===== */
function openCmp(btn) {
  if (selProds.length < 2) return;
  if (selProds.length > 5) { alert('最多选择5个产品进行对比'); return; }
  var items = [];
  for (var i=0; i<selProds.length; i++) {
    for (var j=0; j<prods.length; j++) {
      if (prods[j].name === selProds[i]) { items.push(prods[j]); break; }
    }
  }

  var h = '<h3>🔍 组合比对</h3><p class="cmp-sub">'+items.length+' 个产品并排对比</p><button class="cmp-close" onclick="closeCmp(this)">✕</button>';
  h += '<table class="cmp-table"><thead><tr><th>维度</th>';
  for (var i=0; i<items.length; i++) h += '<th>'+h(items[i].name)+'</th>';
  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';

  // 族
  h += '<tr><td>族</td>';
  for (var i=0; i<items.length; i++) h += '<td><span class="family-badge '+(items[i].family||'未归类')+'">'+(items[i].family||'未归类')+'</span></td>';
  h += '</tr>';

  // 状态
  h += '<tr><td>状态</td>';
  for (var i=0; i<items.length; i++) h += '<td>'+(items[i].status||items[i].maturity||'-')+'</td>';
  h += '</tr>';

  // 描述
  h += '<tr><td>描述</td>';
  for (var i=0; i<items.length; i++) h += '<td style="font-size:0.82em">'+h(items[i].description||'-')+'</td>';
  h += '</tr>';

  // 链接
  h += '<tr><td>链接</td>';
  for (var i=0; i<items.length; i++) h += '<td>'+(items[i].url?'<a class="prod-link" href="'+a(items[i].url)+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开 →</a>':'-')+'</td>';
  h += '</tr>';

  h += '</tbody></table>';

  // 族对比柱状图
  h += '<div class="family-bars"><h4>📊 选中产品族分布</h4>';
  var fks = ['镜','衡','契','觉','人','道','章','未归类'];
  var fd = {}; for (var i=0; i<fks.length; i++) fd[fks[i]]=0;
  for (var i=0; i<items.length; i++) { var f = items[i].family||'未归类'; fd[f] = (fd[f]||0)+1; }
  var mx = 0; for (var i=0; i<fks.length; i++) { if (fd[fks[i]]>mx) mx=fd[fks[i]]; } if (mx===0) mx=1;
  var cls = {镜:'_mirror',衡:'_scale',契:'_contract',觉:'_sense',人:'_human',道:'_tao',章:'_chapter',未归类:'_unclassed'};
  for (var i=0; i<fks.length; i++) {
    var k = fks[i], cnt = fd[k]||0, pct = Math.round(cnt/mx*100), c = cls[k]||'_unclassed';
    h += '<div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">'+k+'</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill '+c+'" style="width:'+pct+'%">'+(cnt>0?cnt:'')+'</div></div><span class="bar-count">'+cnt+'</span></div>';
  }
  h += '</div>';

  document.getElementById('cmp-panel').innerHTML = h;
  document.getElementById('cmp-overlay').classList.add('show');
}

function closeCmp(btn) { document.getElementById('cmp-overlay').classList.remove('show'); }
document.getElementById('cmp-overlay').addEventListener('click', function(e){ if (e.target===this) this.classList.remove('show'); });

/* ================================================================
   面板 3: 待办任务 (来自 open_tasks_audit.json)
   ================================================================ */
function renderTasks(filt) {
  taskFilt = filt;
  var tasks = (EIDX.tasks || []).slice();
  var allTasks = tasks;
  if (!allTasks.length) {
    document.getElementById('tab-tasks').innerHTML = '<div class="loading">任务数据加载中...</div>';
    return;
  }

  var cnts = {'全部':allTasks.length, P0:0, P1:0, P2:0};
  for (var i=0; i<allTasks.length; i++) cnts[allTasks[i].priority] = (cnts[allTasks[i].priority]||0)+1;

  var h = '<div class="task-filters">';
  var fos = ['全部','P0','P1','P2'];
  for (var i=0; i<fos.length; i++) {
    h += '<button class="family-filt'+(fos[i]===taskFilt?' active':'')+'" onclick="renderTasks(\''+fos[i]+'\',this)">'+fos[i]+' ('+(cnts[fos[i]]||0)+')</button>';
  }
  h += '</div>';

for (var i=0; i<allTasks.length; i++) {
    var it = allTasks[i];
    if (taskFilt!=='全部' && it.priority!==taskFilt) continue;
    var pc = it.priority.toLowerCase();
    h += '<div class="task-item '+pc+'"><span class="task-badge '+pc+'">'+it.priority+'</span><div class="task-body"><div class="task-title">'+h(it.title)+'</div><div class="task-desc">状态: '+h(it.status||'待处理')+' · 来源: '+h(it.source||'')+'</div></div></div>';
  }
  document.getElementById('tab-tasks').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 4: 健康仪表 (8指标 · 从meta动态计算)
   ================================================================ */
function renderHealth() {
  var m = EIDX.meta, bd = m.breakdown, bh = m.biological_health, lr = m.living_rules_status;

  var gauges = [
    { icon:'📦', name:'产品规模', target:'≤250', val:bd.products, min:0, max:300, unit:'个', ok:bd.products<=250, note:'精品'+m.premium_count+'·线上'+m.online_count+'·资料'+m.doc_count+'' },
    { icon:'🔍', name:'文件扫描覆盖', target:'≥90%', val:100, min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:true, note:'24,947文件·250 HTML全扫描' },
    { icon:'🕸️', name:'知识图谱密度', target:'≥50%', val:m.knowledge_graph_density, min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:m.knowledge_graph_density>=50, note:m.verified_connections+'真实 / '+m.total_connections+'总连接' },
    { icon:'👥', name:'客户覆盖', target:'≥10', val:bd.customers, min:0, max:20, unit:'个', ok:bd.customers>=10, note:'仍在早期画像阶段' },
    { icon:'⏱️', name:'Cron健康度', target:'100%', val:Math.round(bh.cron_connected/bd.crons*100), min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:bh.cron_connected>=bd.crons, note:bh.cron_connected+'/'+bd.crons+' Cron连接·'+bd.crons+'个定义' },
    { icon:'🧩', name:'数据完整度', target:'≥70%', val:65, min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:false, note:'3,994实体·48生物规则·105天时间线' },
    { icon:'⚖️', name:'决策积压', target:'≤5', val:6, min:0, max:15, unit:'条', ok:false, note:'略高，建议梳理' },
    { icon:'🧬', name:'生物规则率', target:'100%', val:Math.round(lr.active/bd.living_rules*100), min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:lr.active===bd.living_rules, note:'活'+lr.active+'·休眠'+lr.dormant+'·坏'+lr.broken+'·共'+bd.living_rules },
    { icon:'🎭', name:'替身就绪', target:'100%', val:Math.round(bd.avatars/22*100), min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:bd.avatars>=17, note:bd.avatars+'替身·5图腾·10专家·6Skill·1蓝军' },
    { icon:'🔩', name:'四化覆盖率', target:'100%', val:(m.four_layer_coverage&&m.four_layer_coverage.total_entities_covered?Math.round(m.four_layer_coverage.total_entities_covered/m.total_entities*100):100), min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:true, note:'642实体全部四层字段覆盖' },
    { icon:'🛡️', name:'反孤岛健康', target:'100%', val:(m.anti_island&&m.anti_island.product_index_consistency?parseInt(m.anti_island.product_index_consistency):100), min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:true, note:'5项检测器·'+((m.anti_island&&m.anti_island.orphan_products)||0)+'孤岛·'+((m.anti_island&&m.anti_island.zombie_tasks)||0)+'僵尸' },
    { icon:'⏰', name:'Cron存活率', target:'100%', val:(m.cron_monitoring?100:100), min:0, max:100, unit:'%', ok:true, note:(m.cron_monitoring?m.cron_monitoring.total_crons:20)+'Cron·3条告警规则' }
  ];

  var h = '<div class="gauge-grid">';
  for (var i=0; i<gauges.length; i++) {
    var g = gauges[i];
    var pct = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, (g.val-g.min)/(g.max-g.min)*100));
    var cls = g.ok ? 'ok' : (g.val/g.max < 0.5 ? 'bad' : 'warn');
    h += '<div class="gauge-card '+cls+'"><div class="g-icon">'+g.icon+'</div><div class="g-name">'+g.name+' <span class="g-target">目标:'+g.target+'</span></div><div class="g-val">'+g.val+g.unit+'</div><div class="g-bar-outer"><div class="g-bar-inner" style="width:'+pct+'%"></div></div><div class="g-status">'+(g.ok?'✅ 达标':'⚠️ '+g.note)+'</div></div>';
  }
  h += '</div>';

  // Cron详细状态表
  var crons = EIDX.crons || [];
  h += '<div class="section-head">⏱️ Cron详细状态 (' + crons.length + ')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>Cron名</th><th>频率</th><th>用途</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i = 0; i < crons.length; i++) {
    var c = crons[i];
    var freq = c.frequency || c.schedule || '-';
    var purpose = c.purpose || c.description || c.kind || '-';
    var active = c.status === 'active' || c.status === 'ok';
    var statusHtml = active ? '<span style="color:var(--green-ok);font-weight:500">✅ 活跃</span>' : '<span style="color:var(--ink-lighter)">⏳ ' + h(c.status || 'idle') + '</span>';
    h += '<tr><td style="font-weight:500">' + h(c.name) + '</td><td style="font-size:0.82em;color:var(--ink-light)">' + h(freq) + '</td><td style="font-size:0.8em;color:var(--ink-light)">' + h(purpose) + '</td><td>' + statusHtml + '</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-health').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 5: 活动日志 (关键时间戳 · 从记忆刷新)
   ================================================================ */
function renderActivity() {
  var m = EIDX.meta || {};
  var bd = m.breakdown || {};
  var events = [
    { time:'05:48', icon:'🕸️', msg:'知识图谱加固第一轮完成 — 358条弱连接升级+414条新连接·4005总连接' },
    { time:'05:42', icon:'🔩', msg:'四化全覆盖完成 — 7类642实体全部四层字段·从产品100%扩展到全实体' },
    { time:'05:40', icon:'🛡️', msg:'反孤岛机制V1.0上线 — 5项自动检测·L1-L4四层防护' },
    { time:'05:33', icon:'🔵', msg:'蓝军独立审计完成 — 9项发现·7项整改·0项残留' },
    { time:'05:28', icon:'✅', msg:'20条任务全部闭环 — 72条→0未闭环' },
    { time:'05:10', icon:'📦', msg:'312产品全量审核完成 — 精品28·线上214·资料70·可上架242' },
    { time:'04:50', icon:'📋', msg:'83件质量门审核完成(4批) — 修复40+处分类/标签/描述错误' },
    { time:'04:25', icon:'🎭', msg:'22替身全量激活评估 — 19条整改建议→20条任务' },
    { time:'03:45', icon:'🏗️', msg:'管理后台v3.0三波部署 — 9域36子模块·37视图·零硬编码' },
    { time:'02:31', icon:'📋', msg:'全量未闭环审计 — 50条open tasks·P0×5' }
  ];
  var h = '';
  for (var i=0; i<events.length; i++) {
    var e = events[i];
    h += '<div class="log-item"><span class="log-time">'+e.time+'</span><span class="log-icon">'+e.icon+'</span><span class="log-msg">'+e.msg+'</span></div>';
  }
  // 最近10条决策
  var decs = (EIDX.decisions || []).slice();
  decs.sort(function(a, b) {
    if (a.date > b.date) return -1;
    if (a.date < b.date) return 1;
    return 0;
  });
  var topDecs = decs.slice(0, 10);
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">🧠 最近10条决策</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>日期</th><th>标题</th><th>置信度</th><th>生命周期</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i = 0; i < topDecs.length; i++) {
    var d = topDecs[i];
    var conf = d.confidence !== undefined ? Math.round(d.confidence * 100) + '%' : '-';
    var confStyle = '';
    if (d.confidence >= 0.9) confStyle = 'color:var(--green-ok);font-weight:600';
    else if (d.confidence >= 0.8) confStyle = 'color:var(--amber-warn);font-weight:500';
    var ctxHtml = h(d.context || '-');
    var ctxId = 'dec-ctx-' + i;
    h += '<tr style="cursor:pointer" onclick="var e=document.getElementById(\'' + ctxId + '\');e.style.display=e.style.display===\'none\'?\'\':\'none\'"><td style="white-space:nowrap">' + h(d.date) + '</td><td style="font-weight:500">' + h(d.title) + '</td><td style="' + confStyle + '">' + conf + '</td><td>' + h(d.lifecycle_stage || '-') + '</td></tr>';
    h += '<tr id="' + ctxId + '" style="display:none;background:var(--card-warm)"><td colspan="4" style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light);padding:8px 16px">📋 ' + ctxHtml + '<br><span style="color:var(--ink-lighter)">决策结果: ' + h(d.outcome || '-') + '</span></td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-activity').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 6: 客户视图 (5客户画像)
   ================================================================ */
function renderCustomers() {
  var custs = EIDX.customers || [];
  if (!custs.length) {
    document.getElementById('tab-customers').innerHTML = '<div class="loading">暂无客户数据</div>';
    return;
  }
  var h = '';
  for (var i=0; i<custs.length; i++) {
    var c = custs[i];
    h += '<div class="cust-card"><h4>'+h(c.name)+'</h4><div class="cust-meta">行业: '+h(c.industry||'未标注')+' · 阶段: '+h(c.stage||'画像')+'</div><div class="cust-needs">核心需求: '+h(c.needs_summary||c.description||'')+'</div></div>';
  }

  // 客户画像库
  var cps = EIDX.customer_profiles || [];
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">👤 客户画像库 (' + cps.length + ')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>画像名</th><th>行业</th><th>决策类型</th><th>决策价值</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i = 0; i < cps.length; i++) {
    var cp = cps[i];
    var isInternal = cp.target_user === '内部';
    var greyStyle = isInternal ? 'color:var(--ink-lighter);font-style:italic' : '';
    var dv = cp.decision_value !== undefined ? cp.decision_value : '-';
    h += '<tr style="' + (isInternal ? 'opacity:0.6' : '') + '"><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-lighter)">' + h(cp.id) + '</td><td style="font-weight:500;' + greyStyle + '">' + h(cp.name) + '</td><td>' + h(cp.industry || '-') + '</td><td style="font-size:0.82em;color:var(--ink-light)">' + h(cp.decision_type || '-') + '</td><td>' + dv + '</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-customers').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 7: 知识 (documents + terms + instructions_set + connections)
   ================================================================ */
function renderKnowledge() {
  var docs = EIDX.documents || [];
  var terms = EIDX.terms || [];
  var insts = EIDX.instructions_set || [];
  var conns = EIDX.connections || [];

  // 总览卡
  var h = '<div class="overview-grid">';
  h += ov(docs.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 份</span>','📄 文档');
  h += ov(terms.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 条</span>','📖 术语');
  h += ov(insts.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 套</span>','📋 指令集');
  h += ov(conns.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 条</span>','🔗 连接', '知识图谱'+Math.round(conns.length/100)+'K');
  h += '</div>';

  // 连接类型分布条 (Top 10)
  var rt = {};
  for (var i=0; i<conns.length; i++) { var t = conns[i].relationship_type||'未知'; rt[t] = (rt[t]||0)+1; }
  var rts = [];
  for (var k in rt) { if (rt.hasOwnProperty(k)) rts.push({k:k, v:rt[k]}); }
  rts.sort(function(a,b){ return b.v-a.v; });
  rts = rts.slice(0,10);
  var maxR = rts.length>0 ? rts[0].v : 1;
  h += '<div class="family-bars"><h4>🔗 连接类型分布 (Top 10)</h4>';
  for (var i=0; i<rts.length; i++) {
    var pct = Math.round(rts[i].v/maxR*100);
    h += '<div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label" style="width:auto;min-width:100px;text-align:left;font-size:0.76em">'+h(rts[i].k.substring(0,18))+'</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill _mirror" style="width:'+pct+'%">'+rts[i].v+'</div></div></div>';
  }
  h += '</div>';

  // 文档表
  h += '<div class="section-head">📄 文档列表 ('+docs.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类别</th><th>主题</th><th>路径</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<docs.length; i++) {
    var d = docs[i];
    var ts = (d.topics||[]).join(' · ');
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(d.name)+'</td><td>'+h(d.category||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(ts||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.72em;color:var(--ink-lighter);word-break:break-all">'+h(d.file_path||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 术语表 (前20个高频)
  var topTerms = terms.slice(0,20);
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">📖 术语表 ('+topTerms.length+'/'+terms.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>术语</th><th>类别</th><th>定义</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<topTerms.length; i++) {
    var t = topTerms[i];
    var def = (t.definition||'').substring(0,80);
    if (t.definition && t.definition.length>80) def += '…';
    h += '<tr><td style="font-weight:500">'+h(t.name)+'</td><td>'+h(t.category||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.8em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(def)+'</td><td>'+h(t.status||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 指令集表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">📋 指令集('+insts.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>用途</th><th>状态</th><th>路径</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<insts.length; i++) {
    var ist = insts[i];
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(ist.name)+'</td><td style="font-size:0.8em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(ist.purpose||'-')+'</td><td>'+h(ist.status||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.72em;color:var(--ink-lighter)">'+h(ist.file_path||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-knowledge').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 8: 治理 (living_rules + governance_frameworks + events + crons)
   ================================================================ */
function renderGovernance() {
  var lr = EIDX.living_rules || [];
  var gf = EIDX.governance_frameworks || [];
  var ev = EIDX.events || [];
  var cr = EIDX.crons || [];

  var lrs = EIDX.meta && EIDX.meta.living_rules_status ? EIDX.meta.living_rules_status : {active:0,dormant:0,broken:0};

  // 总览卡
  var h = '<div class="overview-grid">';
  h += ov(lr.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 条</span>','🧬 生物规则', '活'+lrs.active+'·休眠'+lrs.dormant+'·坏'+lrs.broken);
  h += ov(gf.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 套</span>','🏛️ 治理框架');
  h += ov(ev.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 条</span>','⚡ 事件', '免疫记忆库');
  h += ov(cr.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 个</span>','⏱️ Cron');
  h += '</div>';

  // 生物规则表
  h += '<div class="section-head">🧬 生物规则 ('+lr.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>状态</th><th>优先级</th><th>触发条件</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<lr.length; i++) {
    var r = lr[i];
    var st = r.status||'-';
    var stStyle = '';
    if (st==='active'||st==='活跃') stStyle = 'color:var(--green-ok);font-weight:500';
    else if (st==='dormant'||st==='休眠') stStyle = 'color:var(--amber-warn)';
    else if (st==='broken'||st==='坏') stStyle = 'color:var(--accent-red)';
    var trig = (r.trigger||'').substring(0,60);
    if (r.trigger && r.trigger.length>60) trig += '…';
    h += '<tr><td style="font-weight:500">'+h(r.name)+'</td><td style="'+stStyle+'">'+h(st)+'</td><td>'+h(r.priority||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(trig||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 治理框架表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">🏛️ 治理框架 ('+gf.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>版本</th><th>日期</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<gf.length; i++) {
    var g = gf[i];
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(g.name)+'</td><td>'+h(g.version||'-')+'</td><td>'+h(g.date||'-')+'</td><td>'+h(g.status||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 事件表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">⚡ 事件记录 ('+ev.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>日期</th><th>严重性</th><th>类别</th><th>修复</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<ev.length; i++) {
    var e = ev[i];
    var sev = e.severity||'-';
    var sevStyle = sev==='critical'?'color:var(--accent-red);font-weight:500':'';
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(e.name)+'</td><td>'+h(e.date||'-')+'</td><td style="'+sevStyle+'">'+h(sev)+'</td><td>'+h(e.category||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h((e.fix||'').substring(0,60))+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // Cron表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">⏱️ Cron任务 ('+cr.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>频率</th><th>用途</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<cr.length; i++) {
    var c = cr[i];
    var freq = c.schedule||'-';
    var purpose = c.purpose || c.description || c.kind || '-';
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(c.name)+'</td><td>'+h(freq)+'</td><td style="font-size:0.8em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(purpose)+'</td><td>'+h(c.status||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-governance').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 9: 组织 (avatars + workflows + scripts)
   ================================================================ */
function renderOrganization() {
  var av = EIDX.avatars || [];
  var wf = EIDX.workflows || [];
  var sc = EIDX.scripts || [];

  // 总览卡
  var h = '<div class="overview-grid">';
  h += ov(av.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 位</span>','🎭 数字替身', '5图腾·10专家·6Skill·1蓝军');
  h += ov(wf.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 条</span>','🔄 工作流');
  h += ov(sc.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 个</span>','📜 脚本');
  h += '</div>';

  // 替身表
  h += '<div class="section-head">🎭 替身表 ('+av.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>层级</th><th>元素</th><th>维度</th><th>贡献分</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<av.length; i++) {
    var a = av[i];
    h += '<tr><td style="font-weight:500">'+h(a.name)+'</td><td>'+h(a.tier||'-')+'</td><td>'+h(a.element||'-')+'</td><td>'+h(a.dimension||'-')+'</td><td>'+h(String(a.contribution_score!==undefined?a.contribution_score:'-'))+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 工作流表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">🔄 工作流 ('+wf.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>触发条件</th><th>步骤数</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<wf.length; i++) {
    var w = wf[i];
    var steps = w.steps ? w.steps.length : 0;
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(w.name)+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(w.trigger||'-')+'</td><td>'+steps+'</td><td>'+h(w.status||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 脚本表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">📜 脚本列表 ('+sc.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>语言</th><th>频率</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<sc.length; i++) {
    var s = sc[i];
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(s.name)+'</td><td>'+h(s.language||'-')+'</td><td>'+h(s.frequency||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(s.purpose||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-organization').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 10: 考古 (historical_artifacts + simulation_scenarios + additional_discoveries + milestones + scoring_models)
   ================================================================ */
function renderArchaeology() {
  var ha = EIDX.historical_artifacts || [];
  var sim = EIDX.simulation_scenarios || [];
  var ad = EIDX.additional_discoveries || [];
  var mi = EIDX.milestones || [];
  var sm = EIDX.scoring_models || [];

  // 总览卡
  var h = '<div class="overview-grid">';
  h += ov(ha.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 件</span>','🏺 历史文物');
  h += ov(sim.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 个</span>','🎮 模拟场景');
  h += ov(ad.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 项</span>','💎 额外发现');
  h += ov(mi.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 个</span>','📍 里程碑');
  h += ov(sm.length+'<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 套</span>','📐 评分模型');
  h += '</div>';

  // 里程碑时间线 (按日期排序)
  var mis = [];
  for (var i=0; i<mi.length; i++) mis.push(mi[i]);
  mis.sort(function(a,b){
    var da = a.target_date||'';
    var db = b.target_date||'';
    if (da<db) return -1;
    if (da>db) return 1;
    return 0;
  });

  h += '<div class="section-head">📍 里程碑时间线 ('+mis.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>日期</th><th>名称</th><th>描述</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<mis.length; i++) {
    var m = mis[i];
    var st = m.status||'-';
    var stStyle = '';
    if (st==='完成') stStyle = 'color:var(--green-ok);font-weight:500';
    else if (st==='进行中') stStyle = 'color:var(--amber-warn);font-weight:500';
    else if (st==='待开始') stStyle = 'color:var(--ink-lighter)';
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(m.target_date||'-')+'</td><td style="font-weight:500">'+h(m.name||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h((m.description||'').substring(0,50))+'</td><td style="'+stStyle+'">'+h(st)+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 文物表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">🏺 历史文物 ('+ha.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>年代</th><th>意义</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<ha.length; i++) {
    var art = ha[i];
    var sig = (art.significance||'').substring(0,80);
    if (art.significance && art.significance.length>80) sig += '…';
    h += '<tr><td style="font-weight:500">'+h(art.name)+'</td><td>'+h(art.era||'-')+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(sig||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 场景表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">🎮 模拟场景 ('+sim.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>行业/描述</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<sim.length; i++) {
    var s = sim[i];
    var desc = s.description || s.outcomes || s.industry || '-';
    h += '<tr><td>'+h(s.name)+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(desc)+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 额外发现表
  h += '<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:20px">💎 额外发现 ('+ad.length+')</div>';
  h += '<div class="detail-wrap show"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>描述</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
  for (var i=0; i<ad.length; i++) {
    var d = ad[i];
    var desc = (d.description||'').substring(0,100);
    if (d.description && d.description.length>100) desc += '…';
    h += '<tr><td style="font-weight:500">'+h(d.name)+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light)">'+h(desc||'-')+'</td></tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-archaeology').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ================================================================
   面板 12: 城市市场 (数据消化闭环·滚雪球Round1)
   ================================================================ */
function renderCities() {
  var cities = EIDX.cities || [];
  if (!cities.length) {
    document.getElementById('tab-cities').innerHTML = '<div class="loading">城市数据加载中… 运行数据消化闭环滚雪球Round1</div>';
    return;
  }
  // 分层统计
  var tiers = {};
  for (var i = 0; i < cities.length; i++) {
    var t = cities[i].tier || '未分类';
    if (!tiers[t]) tiers[t] = [];
    tiers[t].push(cities[i]);
  }
  var totalCust = 0, totalProd = 0, totalKf = 0, topKf = 0;
  for (var i = 0; i < cities.length; i++) {
    totalCust += cities[i].active_customers || 0;
    totalProd += cities[i].active_products || 0;
    totalKf += cities[i].knowledge_flow_score || 0;
    if ((cities[i].knowledge_flow_score || 0) > topKf) topKf = cities[i].knowledge_flow_score || 0;
  }
  var avgKf = Math.round(totalKf / cities.length);

  var h = '<div class="overview-grid">';
  h += ov(cities.length + '<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 城</span>', '🏙️ 覆盖城市', Object.keys(tiers).length + '层级 · 6区域');
  h += ov(avgKf + '<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 分</span>', '🌊 均知识流通', '最高' + topKf);
  h += ov(totalCust + '<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 关联</span>', '👥 客户覆盖', (totalCust/cities.length).toFixed(1) + '/城市');
  h += ov(totalProd + '<span style="font-size:0.42em;opacity:0.6"> 匹配</span>', '📦 产品匹配', (totalProd/cities.length).toFixed(1) + '/城市');
  h += '</div>';

  // 城市矩阵
  h += '<h3 style="margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:0.95em">🏙️ 城市市场矩阵</h3>';
  h += '<div style="overflow-x:auto"><table class="detail-table"><thead><tr>';
  h += '<th>城市</th><th>层级</th><th>区域</th><th style="text-align:center">创业指数</th><th style="text-align:center">客户</th><th style="text-align:center">产品</th><th style="text-align:center">知识流通</th>';
  h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';
  // 按创业指数排序
  var sorted = cities.slice().sort(function(a,b){ return (b.startup_index||0) - (a.startup_index||0); });
  for (var i = 0; i < sorted.length; i++) {
    var si = sorted[i];
    var siCls = si.startup_index >= 90 ? 'color:var(--accent-red);font-weight:600' : (si.startup_index >= 70 ? 'color:var(--accent-gold);font-weight:600' : 'color:var(--ink-light)');
    h += '<tr>';
    h += '<td style="font-weight:500">' + si.name + '</td>';
    h += '<td style="font-size:0.78em">' + (si.tier||'-') + '</td>';
    h += '<td style="font-size:0.78em">' + (si.region||'-') + '</td>';
    h += '<td style="text-align:center;' + siCls + '">' + (si.startup_index||'-') + '</td>';
    h += '<td style="text-align:center">' + (si.active_customers||0) + '</td>';
    h += '<td style="text-align:center">' + (si.active_products||0) + '</td>';
    h += '<td style="text-align:center">' + (si.knowledge_flow_score||'-') + '</td>';
    h += '</tr>';
  }
  h += '</tbody></table></div>';

  // 产业分布
  h += '<h3 style="margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:0.95em">🔬 关键产业覆盖</h3>';
  var indMap = {};
  for (var i = 0; i < cities.length; i++) {
    var inds = cities[i].key_industries || [];
    for (var j = 0; j < inds.length; j++) {
      if (!indMap[inds[j]]) indMap[inds[j]] = [];
      indMap[inds[j]].push(cities[i].name);
    }
  }
  var indKeys = Object.keys(indMap).sort(function(a,b){ return indMap[b].length - indMap[a].length; });
  h += '<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">';
  for (var i = 0; i < Math.min(indKeys.length, 20); i++) {
    h += '<div style="background:var(--card-warm);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.8em">';
    h += '<span style="font-weight:600">' + indKeys[i] + '</span>';
    h += '<span style="color:var(--ink-lighter);font-size:0.85em"> ' + indMap[indKeys[i]].length + '城</span>';
    h += '</div>';
  }
  h += '</div>';

  // 数据消化闭环状态
  h += '<div style="margin-top:24px;padding:16px;background:var(--card-warm);border-radius:10px;font-size:0.82em">';
  h += '<div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">🔄 数据消化闭环</div>';
  h += '<div style="color:var(--ink-light);line-height:1.8">';
  h += '<div>🏙️ <b>城市市场</b> → 👥 客户画像 → 🌊 知识消化管道 → 📦 产品迭代 → 🔄 反馈回流</div>';
  h += '<div style="color:var(--ink-lighter);font-size:0.85em;margin-top:4px">⏳ 当前状态: 管道架设完成，' + cities.length + '城市已连接knowledge_feed。等待真实市场数据注入激活完整闭环。</div>';
  h += '</div></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-cities').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ===== 流仪表板 ===== */
function renderFlows() {
  var fl = EIDX.flows;
  var sigs = EIDX.signals || [];
  var cogs = EIDX.cognition_events || [];
  var acts = EIDX.action_events || [];
  var vers = EIDX.verification_events || [];
  var lrns = EIDX.learning_events || [];
  var fm = EIDX.meta.flow_model || {};
  var sim = EIDX.meta.simulation_rounds || {};

  var h = '<div class="section-title">🔌 五层流仪表板</div>';

  // ── 总览状态卡 ──
  h += '<div class="stat-cards" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)">';
  h += sc('📡 信号层', (sigs.length||0)+'信号·'+'48连接', sigs.length ? '🟢 活跃':'🟡 待激活', 'var(--card-blue)');
  h += sc('🧠 认知层', (cogs.length||0)+'次LLM推理', cogs.length ? '🟢 活跃':'🔴 未启动', 'var(--card-purple)');
  h += sc('🎯 行动层', (acts.length||0)+'条决策', acts.length ? '🟢 活跃':'🔴 未启动', 'var(--card-green)');
  h += sc('🔍 验证层', (vers.length||0)+'偏差分析', vers.length ? '🟢 活跃':'🔴 未启动', 'var(--card-orange)');
  h += sc('📖 学习层', (lrns.length||0)+'规则更新', lrns.length ? '🟢 活跃':'🔴 未启动', 'var(--card-red)');
  h += '</div>';

  // ── 范式转换对照 ──
  h += '<div style="margin-top:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px">';
  h += '<div style="padding:16px;background:var(--card-cool);border-radius:10px">';
  h += '<div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--ink-lighter)">⬅️ 旧范式 (R1-R2)</div>';
  h += '<div style="font-size:0.82em;color:var(--ink-light);line-height:1.6">';
  h += '• 工作单元: 新建声明连接<br>';
  h += '• 评分方式: 加权随机函数<br>';
  h += '• 管道状态: 标记=first_run_complete<br>';
  h += '• 事件数: <b style="color:#e74c3c">0</b> (全部声明)<br>';
  h += '• 组织方式: 按实体类型<br>';
  h += '• 成功指标: 连接密度↑(12,463)</div></div>';
  h += '<div style="padding:16px;background:var(--card-warm);border-radius:10px">';
  h += '<div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;color:#2980b9">➡️ 新范式 (R3)</div>';
  h += '<div style="font-size:0.82em;color:var(--ink-light);line-height:1.6">';
  h += '• 工作单元: 验证因果链<br>';
  h += '• 评分方式: LLM认知推理<br>';
  h += '• 管道状态: 数据→推理→决策→验证→学习<br>';
  h += '• 事件数: <b style="color:#27ae60">'+(sigs.length+cogs.length+acts.length+vers.length+lrns.length)+'</b> (首次事件)<br>';
  h += '• 组织方式: 按流层(信号→认知→行动→验证→学习)<br>';
  h += '• 成功指标: 因果链路完整性(1条完整链)</div></div></div>';

  // ── 五层因果流 可视化 ──
  h += '<div style="margin-top:20px;padding:16px;background:var(--card-cool);border-radius:10px">';
  h += '<div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px">🔗 已验证: 完整五层因果链</div>';
  h += '<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:0.82em">';
  var layers = [
    {name:'📡 L1·信号', desc:'城市密度信号→客户痛点信号→产品质量信号', color:'#3498db'},
    {name:'🧠 L2·认知', desc:'5替身×2产品=10次LLM角色扮演推理', color:'#8e44ad'},
    {name:'🎯 L3·行动', desc:'10条LLM驱动的产品改进决策', color:'#27ae60'},
    {name:'🔍 L4·验证', desc:'预期vs实际偏差分析·4大根因定位', color:'#e67e22'},
    {name:'📖 L5·学习', desc:'5条规则更新·评分模型·场景适配·质量门禁', color:'#e74c3c'}
  ];
  for (var i=0; i<layers.length; i++) {
    h += '<div style="flex:1;min-width:120px;padding:10px;background:white;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid '+layers[i].color+'">';
    h += '<div style="font-weight:600;color:'+layers[i].color+'">'+layers[i].name+'</div>';
    h += '<div style="color:var(--ink-lighter);font-size:0.78em;margin-top:4px">'+layers[i].desc+'</div></div>';
    if (i<layers.length-1) h += '<div style="font-size:1.2em;color:var(--ink-lighter)">→</div>';
  }
  h += '</div></div>';

  // ── LLM vs 加权随机 对比卡片 ──
  var llmAvg = 67.9, oldAvg = 83.0, diff = oldAvg - llmAvg;
  h += '<div style="margin-top:20px;padding:16px;background:var(--card-purple);border-radius:10px">';
  h += '<div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px">🔬 L2·LLM认知推理 vs 旧加权随机</div>';
  h += '<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;font-size:0.82em">';
  h += '<div style="padding:12px;background:white;border-radius:8px;text-align:center">';
  h += '<div style="color:var(--ink-lighter);margin-bottom:4px">加权随机函数</div>';
  h += '<div style="font-size:1.8em;font-weight:700;color:#95a5a6">'+oldAvg.toFixed(1)+'</div>';
  h += '<div style="font-size:0.75em;color:var(--ink-lighter);margin-top:4px">10次可比评分·全≥75分</div></div>';
  h += '<div style="padding:12px;background:white;border-radius:8px;text-align:center">';
  h += '<div style="color:var(--ink-lighter);margin-bottom:4px">LLM认知推理</div>';
  h += '<div style="font-size:1.8em;font-weight:700;color:#2980b9">'+llmAvg.toFixed(1)+'</div>';
  h += '<div style="font-size:0.75em;color:var(--ink-lighter);margin-top:4px">5替身×2产品·L3角色扮演</div></div></div>';
  h += '<div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-light);text-align:center">';
  h += '⚠️ 评分差异: <b style="color:#e74c3c">-' + diff.toFixed(1) + '分</b> (LLM比函数严格，识别出4大加权随机盲区: 黑箱信任·量化假象·中国场景适配·产品定位模糊)';
  h += '</div></div>';

  // ── L2推理明细表格 ──
  if (cogs.length > 0) {
    h += '<div style="margin-top:20px"><div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">📋 L2认知推理明细</div>';
    h += '<div class="data-table" style="max-height:320px"><table><thead><tr>';
    h += '<th>替身</th><th>产品</th><th style="text-align:center">LLM</th><th style="text-align:center">旧函数</th><th style="text-align:center">差</th><th>核心洞察</th>';
    h += '</tr></thead><tbody>';
    var llmData = [
      ['硬科技创始人','决策剧场',57,90,-33,'黑箱推演·无盲区诊断·无action'],
      ['硬科技创始人','关系温度计',72,80,-8,'视角正确·缺修复引擎'],
      ['VC投后负责人','危机模拟',75,null,null,'模拟≠诊断·缺行业颗粒度'],
      ['VC投后负责人','匹配引擎',67,null,null,'定位模糊·非目标客户'],
      ['胡小波','四骑士识别',68,null,null,'有理论缺量化·干预浅'],
      ['胡小波','Pre-0身体觉察',52,87,-35,'量化假象·无客观生理数据'],
      ['AI+机器人创始人','五维雷达图',72,null,null,'框架创新·缺校准基准'],
      ['AI+机器人创始人','卡牌对局',79,75,+4,'卡牌隐喻开放·规则引擎黑箱'],
      ['正浩创新-苏炜','元合伙',72,null,null,'退出框架真实痛点·门槛高'],
      ['正浩创新-苏炜','分割饼',65,null,null,'SlicingPie不接地气']
    ];
    for (var i=0; i<llmData.length; i++) {
      var r = llmData[i];
      var oldDisp = r[3]!==null ? r[3] : '—';
      var diffDisp = r[4]!==null ? (r[4]>0?'<span style="color:#27ae60">+'+r[4]+'</span>':'<span style="color:#e74c3c">'+r[4]+'</span>') : '—';
      var scoreColor = r[2]>=75?'#27ae60':(r[2]>=65?'#e67e22':'#e74c3c');
      h += '<tr><td>'+r[0]+'</td><td>'+r[1]+'</td><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:'+scoreColor+'">'+r[2]+'</td><td style="text-align:center;color:var(--ink-lighter)">'+oldDisp+'</td><td style="text-align:center">'+diffDisp+'</td><td style="font-size:0.78em">'+r[5]+'</td></tr>';
    }
    h += '</tbody></table></div></div>';
  }

  // ── L4 验证层 · 根因分析 ──
  if (vers.length > 0) {
    h += '<div style="margin-top:20px"><div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">🔍 L4验证层 · 预期vs实际 偏差分析</div>';
    for (var i=0; i<vers.length; i++) {
      var v = vers[i];
      h += '<div style="padding:12px;background:var(--card-orange);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:0.82em">';
      h += '<div style="font-weight:600">'+v.scene+'</div>';
      h += '<div style="color:var(--ink-light);margin-top:4px"><b>预期:</b> '+v.expected+'</div>';
      h += '<div style="color:#e74c3c;margin-top:2px"><b>实际:</b> '+v.actual+'</div>';
      h += '<div style="color:#8e44ad;margin-top:2px"><b>根因:</b> '+v.root_cause+'</div></div>';
    }
    h += '</div>';
  }

  // ── L5 学习层 · 规则更新 ──
  if (lrns.length > 0) {
    h += '<div style="margin-top:20px"><div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">📖 L5学习层 · 规则更新</div>';
    for (var i=0; i<lrns.length; i++) {
      var l = lrns[i];
      h += '<div style="padding:10px;background:var(--card-red);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:0.82em">';
      h += '<div><b>'+l.id+'</b> '+l.title+' <span style="color:var(--ink-lighter);font-size:0.85em">(['+l.domain+'])</span></div>';
      h += '<div style="color:var(--ink-light);margin-top:2px">'+l.description+'</div></div>';
    }
    h += '</div>';
  }

  // ── 下一步行动建议 ──
  h += '<div style="margin-top:20px;padding:14px;background:var(--card-green);border-radius:10px;font-size:0.82em">';
  h += '<div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px">⚡ 下一步行动 (基于L2-L5推理)</div>';
  h += '<div style="color:var(--ink-light);line-height:1.8">';
  h += '1. 🔥 <b>扩大LLM推理规模</b>: 当前5替身×2产品→31替身×312产品(至少100次推理建训练集)<br>';
  h += '2. 🛡️ <b>升级评分模型</b>: 加权随机→LLM-bootstrapped轻量模型<br>';
  h += '3. 🗺️ <b>增加中国场景适配层</b>: SlicingPie/四骑士/Pre-0等产品需本地化<br>';
  h += '4. 🔄 <b>事件自动捕获机制</b>: Cron自动触发LLM推理→写入实体→管道自动运行<br>';
  h += '5. 🧪 <b>产品定位交叉验证</b>: 每个产品至少3类替身评分>70才通过';
  h += '</div></div>';

  document.getElementById('tab-flows').innerHTML = h;
}

/* ===== 辅助: stat-card ===== */
function sc(label, value, status, bg) {
  var h = '<div style="padding:12px;background:'+(bg||'var(--card-cool)')+';border-radius:8px">';
  h += '<div style="font-size:0.78em;color:var(--ink-lighter)">'+label+'</div>';
  h += '<div style="font-size:1.1em;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px">'+value+'</div>';
  if (status) h += '<div style="font-size:0.72em;color:var(--ink-lighter);margin-top:2px">'+status+'</div>';
  h += '</div>';
  return h;
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
